      "value": "@{6114aaf8d186e91de69443da|full_name}: I may have resolved the issue in my world, but I still need to to extensive testing\nI had bought some assets off the unity store that came with amplify shaders which used cubemaps. from my understanding cubemaps are outdated, and cause crashes as described in later versions of unity.\nThere is a separate crash happening similar to how ive described about a VRAM leak with Realtime Global Illumination which you can look into here: https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/1121-vram-leak-when-using-vrccustomrendererbehaviourrendererextensionsupdategima\nthis may be related to your situation.\n I will update once I confirm my crash has been resolved.",
      "viewerReactions": null
